+**Pseudocode:**
+```python
+# Fragment Shader Logic
+# textCoord: vec3, deformed object-space coordinates provided by rasterization
+# texD: sampler3D, 3D texture containing undeformed volume v
+# invDeform: function(vec3) -> vec3, implements the inverse deformation function u
+
+vec3 deformed_coords = textCoord;
+vec3 undeformed_coords = invDeform(deformed_coords);
+
+# Sample the undeformed volume at the calculated undeformed coordinates
+float scalar_value = texture3D(texD, undeformed_coords);
+
+# Apply transfer function to get color
+vec4 color = transfer_function(scalar_value);
+
+# Accumulate color (caller handles compositing loop and early termination)
+return color;
+```
